ADDITIONAL NOTICE — PAPER TRADING ONLY, NO FINANCIAL ADVICE

This project is a research/educational artifact that exercises a paper
(simulated) trading account. It is **not** financial advice, and it must
**never** be configured to trade real money. Multiple guardrails in the
code (TrdEnv.SIMULATE hardcoded, tool signatures with no real-env param,
PreToolUse hook rejecting real-account keywords) exist specifically to
prevent that. If you fork this and lift those guardrails to route real
orders, you do so entirely at your own risk; the author accepts no
liability for any resulting losses, broker disputes, or regulatory
consequences. Trade paper, learn the loop, and if you ever graduate to
real capital, build your own risk framework with proper professional
review.
